# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RUST & CARGO
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ignore all target build directories anywhere in the project
target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock 
# Note: For executable games (Bevy client), some teams commit Cargo.lock to lock dependency versions. 
# For SpacetimeDB backend modules, it is often best to commit it as well to ensure identical server builds. 
# Remove Cargo.lock from this ignore list if you want strictly reproducible builds across machines.

